WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.720
You need bush bean seeds labelled untreated, potting mix, and two or three pots with

2
00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:08.720
drainage holes.

3
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.200
Fill each pot with potting mix to about two centimetres below the rim.

4
00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:16.400
Push two or three seeds about three centimetres deep.

5
00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:18.900
Water until it drips out the bottom.

6
00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.340
Set the pot in the sunniest window.

7
00:00:22.233 --> 00:00:23.293
Visit once a week.

8
00:00:23.693 --> 00:00:27.933
In warm weather, a hooked stem usually pushes up in 5 to 14 days.

9
00:00:28.733 --> 00:00:31.733
Flowers usually open about 4 to 7 weeks after planting.

10
00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:34.527
Do not eat raw bean pods or seeds.

11
00:00:34.867 --> 00:00:36.927
Keep loose seeds away from children under four.
